WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.835
-Police in Idaho on Saturday
arrested 31 people

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:05.304
who are allegedly members
of the white-supremacist group,

00:00:05.304 --> 00:00:07.273
the Patriot Front,
after they were caught

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:08.942
outside a Pride parade.

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:12.178
The group was hiding inside a
U-Haul truck, wearing riot gear,

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:14.314
and was apparently planning to
attack the event.

00:00:14.314 --> 00:00:17.450 line:0%
-Police were tipped off by what
they called a concerned citizen

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:20.019 line:0%
who said they witnessed what
looked like a little Army.

00:00:20.019 --> 00:00:21.454 line:0%
the group hopped into a U-Haul,

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:24.090 line:0%
in the back of a hotel parking
lot, wearing masks, shields,

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.358 line:0%
and shin guards.

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:28.494 line:0%
All 31 members were charged with
conspiracy to riot.

00:00:28.494 --> 00:00:30.363
-One of my writers,
Jenny Hagel, is gay,

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:35.701
and she's here to comment.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:38.204
-Thanks, Seth.
This news is really upsetting.

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.439
Pride events should be joyful
celebrations,

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:42.908
not targets for hate
and violence.

00:00:42.908 --> 00:00:46.546
The people arrested this weekend
are awful human beings.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:49.883
Also, they're a bunch of dorks.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:53.019
-I'm sorry, "dorks"?
-Yeah.

00:00:53.019 --> 00:00:56.956
They were going to attack a
Pride parade in Idaho,

00:00:56.956 --> 00:01:00.159
an event attended by literally
hundreds?

00:01:00.159 --> 00:01:02.528
[ Laughter ]
Okay, tough guys.

00:01:02.528 --> 00:01:05.331
The only place with fewer queer
people is a Talbots.

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:08.134
[ Laughter ]
Come try that [Bleep] at the

00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:11.171
Pride parade in New York,
attended by 2 million people

00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:13.306
who spend the rest
of the year at the gym.

00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:15.241
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:18.644
Also, these idiots got arrested
before they even

00:01:18.644 --> 00:01:20.579
committed the crime.

00:01:20.579 --> 00:01:23.049
What a bunch of nerds!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:24.884
When I was in high school,
I got grounded for

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:26.486
staying at Denny's past curfew,

00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:28.922
but at least I got to the
Denny's.

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:30.890
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:34.860
These guys weren't even found
out by the police or the FBI.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:38.297
They were caught when a random
citizen called in a tip.

00:01:38.297 --> 00:01:41.234
That is the dorkiest thing I've
ever heard.

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:43.436
That's like trying to rob a bank
and getting stopped

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:46.672
by a crossing guard.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.672 --> 00:01:48.741
I will say one thing, though.

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:51.310
The thing that really upset me
about this attack

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:53.112
was how personal it was.

00:01:53.112 --> 00:01:56.015
They really got us in the place
that was most vulnerable.

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:59.752
-You mean Pride month?
-No, I mean a U-Haul.

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:02.555
[ Laughter ]
They tried to attack queer women

00:02:02.555 --> 00:02:05.524
by jumping out of a U-Haul,

00:02:05.524 --> 00:02:09.128
the chosen form of
transportation for lesbians.

00:02:09.128 --> 00:02:10.830
[ Laughter ]
-Wait.

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.599
And I'm sorry,
why is that, again?

00:02:12.599 --> 00:02:14.534
-Because we move in together
very quickly.

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:16.268
We've been over this, Seth.
-Okay, yeah, sorry, sorry.

00:02:16.268 --> 00:02:17.703
I'm sorry. continue.

00:02:17.703 --> 00:02:20.105
-But the worst part of this
whole thing

00:02:20.105 --> 00:02:23.376
is that these guys
were gonna attack in khakis.

00:02:23.376 --> 00:02:26.379
That's our uniform!
[ Sighs ]

00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:28.715
That's like if the Nazis tried
to catch the Von Trapps

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:31.083
while wearing curtains.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:35.221
Truly a low blow.
Look, here's the thing.

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:38.123
It's pride month, and it's easy
to feel sometimes like the fight

00:02:38.123 --> 00:02:41.093
for LGBTQ+ rights is over.

00:02:41.093 --> 00:02:43.429
But the arrest this weekend
reminds us that queer people

00:02:43.429 --> 00:02:45.898
still need protection from state
and federal governments

00:02:45.898 --> 00:02:47.332
and from our allies.

00:02:47.332 --> 00:02:49.402
It shows us that there are
people out there who think

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:54.307
America is for a small, dorky
few, instead of for everyone.

00:02:54.307 --> 00:02:56.175
And worst of all,
it shows us that

00:02:56.175 --> 00:02:58.177
you can't always trust
a U-Haul.

00:02:58.177 --> 00:03:01.180
[ Laughter ]
-Jenny Hagel, everybody!

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:03.716
[ Cheers and applause ]
Thank you so much, Jenny!

